From: Lei Wei <quic_leiwei@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:11:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ppe: provide MAC port operations and controller contracts

Describe the final MAC, phylink, register and port contracts for the IPQ9574 PPE. Keep EDMA controller, netdevice, RX, TX, diagnostics and ethtool implementations in their corresponding units.

Split from:
  0327-net-ppe-mac-port-operations.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: provide PPE phylink and MAC port operations
  0331-net-ethernet-qualcomm-Add-EDMA-support-for-QCOM-IPQ9.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: Add EDMA support for QCOM IPQ9574  chipset.
  0332-net-ethernet-qualcomm-Add-netdevice-support-for-QCOM.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: Add netdevice support for QCOM  IPQ9574 chipset.
  0342-net-qualcomm-Update-IPQ9574-PPE-driver.patch - net: qualcomm: Update IPQ9574 PPE driver

Merged from:
  0327-net-ppe-mac-port-operations.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: provide PPE phylink and MAC port operations
